---
import { SITE_TITLE, AUTHOR_NAME } from '../consts';

const today = new Date();
const year = today.getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-zinc-200/70 dark:border-zinc-800/70">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
		<div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 sm:flex-row">
			<!-- 品牌区 -->
			<div class="max-w-xs">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
					<span
						class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-600 via-sky-500 to-cyan-400 text-sm font-bold text-white"
						aria-hidden="true"
					>
						L
					</span>
					<span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">{SITE_TITLE}</span>
				</div>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">
				{AUTHOR_NAME} 的数字自留地。记录技术笔记、项目复盘与生活随想，把踩过的坑写成文字，分享给同样在路上的人。
			</p>
		</div>

			<!-- 导航 -->
			<nav class="flex gap-10 text-sm" aria-label="页脚导航">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
					<span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200">站点</span>
					<a href="/" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">首页</a>
					<a href="/blog" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">博客</a>
					<a href="/archive" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">归档</a>
					<a href="/tags" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">标签</a>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
					<span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-200">更多</span>
					<a href="/projects" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">项目</a>
					<a href="/links" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">友链</a>
					<a href="/about" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">关于</a>
					<a href="/rss.xml" class="text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600 dark:text-zinc-500 dark:hover:text-amber-300">RSS 订阅</a>
				</div>
			</nav>
		</div>

		<div
			class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-zinc-200/70 pt-6 text-xs text-zinc-400 sm:flex-row dark:border-zinc-800/70 dark:text-zinc-500"
		>
			<span>&copy; {year} {AUTHOR_NAME}。保留所有权利。</span>
			<span>
				由 {AUTHOR_NAME} 设计与构建
			</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
